  (b) contains no source code of the Program, other than material that is part
      of the Official Extension ABI as defined above; and
  (c) is not itself a modified version of the Program.

Communicating through the Official Extension ABI includes being loaded,
sandboxed, and invoked by the Program at runtime as a WebAssembly component, or
being rendered by the Program as a widget.


